    },
    {
        "text": "The assassin leaps out of the shadows, her broken sword almost cleaving a gash across Theresis's chest. He moves aside and draws his own sword, pressing it against the assassin's neck."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "name": "avg_npc_1301_1#1$1",
            "duration": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "right",
            "name": "avg_npc_1297_1#1$1",
            "duration": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "name": "avg_npc_1301_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "right",
            "name": "avg_npc_1297_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Theresis",
        "text": "The angle of the sun leaves a shadow that covers the entire street."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Theresis",
        "text": "You've been waiting for this moment the whole time."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Theresis",
        "text": "This maximizes your advantage, conceals your body, and allows you to approach your enemy. However, during such particular times of the day and the night, your enemy will in turn be more sensitive to changes in their surroundings."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "name": "avg_npc_1301_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon",
        "text": "Alright, got it."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon",
        "text": "I've tried seven times this afternoon, but failed every time."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "right",
            "name": "avg_npc_1297_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Theresis",
        "text": "Were you stalking some other quarry, you would have succeeded a long time ago."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "right",
            "name": "avg_npc_1297_1#3$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Theresis",
        "text": "You've cut the straps of my breastplate... with a longsword I broke."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "right",
            "name": "avg_npc_1297_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Theresis",
        "text": "We stop here for today. Tomorrow, we continue."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "name": "avg_npc_1301_1#3$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "name": "avg_npc_1301_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon",
        "text": "Yesterday, two drunken mercenaries burst into our workplace and threw a flask of wine filled with active Originium dust on the floor."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon",
        "text": "At the time, Her Highness was bandaging the wounds of two children in the great hall."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon",
        "text": "It was no accident."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "right",
            "name": "avg_npc_1297_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Theresis",
        "text": "I know, and I have seen to it."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "name": "avg_npc_1301_1#4$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon",
        "text": "There have been more and more incidents like this lately."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon",
        "text": "The Military Commission... Can't you protect Her Highness and Babel? Are you really unable to stop them, or have you been secretly supporting them this whole time?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "right",
            "name": "avg_npc_1297_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Theresis",
        "text": "There is no need for you to question me on these matters, Ascalon."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Theresis",
        "text": "I know what is best for the Sarkaz. You do not."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "name": "avg_npc_1301_1#4$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon",
        "text": "But, Master..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "name": "avg_npc_1301_1#5$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon",
        "text": "If there really are people acting against Her Highness, will you act against them?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "right",
            "name": "avg_npc_1297_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Theresis",
        "text": "I will."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "name": "avg_npc_1301_1#5$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon",
        "text": "Then, if some others backed you and forced you to fight her, would you act against her too?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "focus": "n"
        }
    },
    {
        "text": "There is only silence."
    },
    {
        "text": "But the both of them hold an answer in their hearts."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "name": "avg_npc_1301_1#2$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon",
        "text": "This is the last lesson you'll be teaching me, Master."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "name": "avg_npc_1301_1#3$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon",
        "text": "I haven't figured everything out yet... but from tomorrow onwards, I'll be by Her Highness's side, protecting her."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "name": "avg_npc_1301_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon",
        "text": "Doing what you should have been doing from the start."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "focus": "n"
        }
    },
    {
        "text": "Ascalon speaks no more, stooping to pick up the broken sword Theresis had knocked aside along with the scattered, cut straps that she considers her prize."
    },
    {
        "text": "She does not look back as she leaves."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
